    "updated_at": "2026-03-10T15:34:38Z",
    "body": "This isn't even IDL mixins. This is objects that support some internal operation. If we had formalized internal slots we could probably do something. Every platform object with an exports origin slot would become eligible or some such and then you'd need some IDL syntax to be able to express that and you'd OR with `DOMString` and done.",
